WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.340
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.920
Toji...

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.480
Toji!

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.590
Momo-chan...

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:03.540
l want to find happiness...

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.440
lt's all right for me
to be happy, isn't it?

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:13.360
"'Continuous Love Storm Warnings"'

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:21.340
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.170
Hey, did you hear that story?

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:25.840
So then... Huh?

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.180
Hey, what is this?

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:32.130
What's going on? Why are those two
walking to school together?

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.460
Adachi! Come here a minute!

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:59.210
What's up with you coming with Toji?

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.810
Just as school starts!
Everybody's gonna talk.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.480
Uh... yeah...

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:07.820
We can understand how you feel,
Adachi, but quit with the insinuations.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.150
Okayasu knows he screwed up,
I'm sure of it.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:13.490
He didn't go on the trip with you, right?

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:17.830
That Okayasu can be so dumb,
coming late to his date with you!

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.160
How do you know all this?

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:24.390
Because he was frantically looking
for you, Adachi. He called everybody!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.500
We were worried, too!
We've been calling you

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.840
since the day before yesterday,
but couldn't get through.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.180
I'm sorry... I'd turned it off...

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.510
I thought so!

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:38.810
So, Adachi, where were you all that time?

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.950
You know, yesterday I
had to meet someone,

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.850
so I was waiting at the station,

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.910
and I saw you, Adachi.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:51.190
You were with Toji.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:54.860
At first I thought you'd
just bumped into each other.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.760
I don't want to think this,
but were you coming home from your trip?

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:03.300
Okayasu didn't come,
so you went with Toji instead?

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.480
Don't you think that's pretty awful?

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.070
Nami!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.480
He was frantically looking for you.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.150
Okayasu didn't come,
so you went with Toji instead?

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.090
Don't you think that's pretty awful?

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:28.500
Oh, what am l gonna do? lf Okayasu
hears about this, how is he gonna feel?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.500
What should l do when l see him?

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.490
Good morning!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.360
Sorry I didn't go the other day!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.180
Yo! What are you guys up to?

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.180
Homework!

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.510
Under the wire, you little creep?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.510
Ah, shaddup!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.850
What's this? He's so cheerful!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.180
He's acting like nothing at all happened...

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:03.460
What a fool l've been! Okayasu never
thought of me the way l thought of him!

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:07.800
l've had it! l'm not gonna
cry over Okayasu any more!

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.470
The opening ceremony for the
new school term will begin at 9:30.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:13.670
All students please assemble
in the school gymnasium.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.820
Shall we go?

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.150
Mm-hmm.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:25.820
What about Nami and Ritsuko?

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.820
They went on ahead.

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:29.220
I see...

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:33.630
Listen, Adachi,
about what happened earlier,

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:35.500
have you and Toji
gotten back together again?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.500
Mm-hmm.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:42.500
O- oh, you have. It was kinda sudden,
and so it was sorta hard to believe...

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:45.510
So, um... can I ask you something?

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.030
Why did you go back to Toji?

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:56.520
Because through it all,
he was looking out for me.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.520
Huh? Through it all?

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.790
Um... well, it's a pretty long story...

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.460
Tell me! I want to hear it!
Until I'm okay with all this!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.130
Uh... okay.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.460
Come on, Kairi! What's happened
between you and Adachi?

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.130
She came to school with Toji this morning!

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.470
Are you gonna just let that happen?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.470
Those two had a
summer job together, right?

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:20.070
Yeah, I saw them!
They were mighty friendly!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.640
--This is no laughing matter!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.470
Sorry, you girls go on ahead...

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.150
What is it, Misao-chan?

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:38.490
Um, you know what? Adachi-san came
to school with Tojigamori-kun this morning.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:41.500
Everybody's told me already!

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.860
Did you see Adachi-san that day?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.170
Unh-unh.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.500
Have you told her why you were late?

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.500
Nope.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:55.180
Why not?! You have to tell her!
I'll go tell Adachi-san myself!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.510
It's okay, it's okay!

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:01.780
What's okay?! You decided, didn't you,
that Adachi-san was the one you wanted?

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.750
Then you have to tell her!

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.120
I told you it was okay already...

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:12.650
What's wrong with you, Kairi?
How can you give up this easily?

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.160
Misao-chan! How did you get bruise?!

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.130
It's nothing! I just ran into something.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.360
Into what?! Lemme see!

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:32.150
I see... So, that's what happened. I had
no idea you went through all that, Adachi.

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.810
Well, we better go.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:38.490
You're so secretive.
You never tell us anything.

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:39.490
Sorry.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.490
Don't worry. It's not
an easy thing to talk about.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:47.490
Well, now I finally know why Toji
suddenly started dating Kashiwagi.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:51.500
It was all to protect you, Adachi.
Wow, that's cool.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.090
Most guys couldn't do that.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:58.170
But I guess it was the
only thing he could do.

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:01.070
After all, you guys had been
crazy for each other for ages.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.610
Let's go.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.790
So, even now, Okayasu still
has feelings for Misao-chan...

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:23.420
So, I want everyone to buckle down
and work hard this term...

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:30.870
Nami! Ritsuko!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.140
They hate me...

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:39.810
No, that's not true! Um... you see...

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:42.580
Nami broke up with her boyfriend.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:49.160
One day she just couldn't get ahold of him,
and in the end, he just dropped her.

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:52.160
And now it looks like
he's got a new girlfriend.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.490
Oh...

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.830
It's got nothing
to do with you, Adachi,

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.830
but it's kind of one on top of the other,
and she's seeing them together.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.300
She's kinda nervous these days.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.770
I can't believe it!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.770
The trip she said she'd take
with Okayasu, she goes with Toji!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.110
Lower your voice!

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:13.780
But I don't think Adachi is the type to
just jump from one guy to the next...

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.120
You think?!

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:17.550
I didn't say this earlier,
but when I saw Adachi and Toji,

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.790
they were in each others' arms!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:24.460
And Adachi was the one who grabbed him!
On the street in front of the station!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.220
I've really been wrong
about Adachi all this time!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:33.130
l wonder if l should
tell Okayasu about Toji...

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.140
Rather than have him hear it
from someone else...

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:39.940
But first, l have to decide what's right...

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.150
Sae!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.820
Why are you so late?
The opening ceremony is over already!

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.820
On the way to school,
I suddenly felt sick...

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:54.820
Anemia?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.580
She's white as a sheet!

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.160
Let's go to the Nurse's Office!
Misao-chan should be there.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:05.170
No way! I don't need that bitch
to take care of me!

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.500
Sae?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:11.500
Are you eating properly?
You're looking a little thin...

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.840
Summer loss of appetite?
You've gotta eat or you'll collapse.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.510
I'm going home...

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.280
All there is after this is homeroom.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.850
If you can lie down somewhere,
I'll take you home after that.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:23.850
No, I can make it alone...

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.520
But...

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.190
Sae, what happened there?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.590
--Nothing.
--Nothing?

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:36.530
Phew! It stinks in here! Forget it!
Let's find another bathroom.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:38.190
Hey! Nami!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:43.540
Now, quit acting like this!
It makes you look terrible!

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.740
Maybe you had some
awful things happen, Nami,

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.570
but that's no reason
to jump all over Adachi!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.210
I'm sorry.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:56.220
I apologize for taking it out on you,

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.220
but I still can't forgive you
for what you did, Adachi!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:03.560
It's like you wanted insurance! If Okayasu
didn't work out, you'd fall back on Toji!

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:05.160
I don't think that's right!

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.490
He was only an hour
or two late, wasn't he?!

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:11.830
Nami, listen! There are reasons
that you know nothing about...

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:15.170
Reasons or no reasons, I'm saying I can't
believe how crass she is to go with Toji...

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:17.500
on a trip she was supposed
to take with Okayasu!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.510
It's like she didn't care
which one of them she had!

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:21.840
Nami! That's enough!

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:29.520
That day, even if Okayasu had shown up,
I don't think I'd have gone with him.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.850
We had promised that
I'd only wait five minutes.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:34.980
Why? If you love him,
you can wait longer than that!

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:40.860
It's because I loved him
that I couldn't wait.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:44.200
That five minutes meant
the whole world to me...

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.540
What? You love him, so you can't wait
for him? What is that? I don't get it!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.870
Nami-chan!

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:53.030
Don't be so hard on Momo-chan.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.680
Okayasu! He heard all that?

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:02.150
But Okayasu, you had a
reason for being late, right?

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:05.150
But she wrote you off without even
hearing it! That's a little one-sided!

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.980
I put my first love first.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:13.820
What? Your first love? You mean you have
someone you love in addition to Adachi?

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:19.830
So, you got back together
with Toji. That's good.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:22.100
You'll find happiness with Toji.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:26.760
I'm sorry. I wasn't able to
fulfill your dreams, Momo-chan.

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:34.440
"'Girl's Bathroom"'

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:56.870
Hey, did you hear? Kairi's got another girl
besides Adachi that he's in love with!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:58.200
Good grief!

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:01.240
And Adachi was being double-crossed!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.810
He got tired of her,
so he tossed her aside!

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:05.480
For real?! That's wicked!

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.480
Is that what Kairi is really like?

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:08.820
Well, I'm bummed.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:12.150
Well, I'd be delighted
to have Kairi toy with me!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.820
Oh, yuck!

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:17.160
And that's why
those two got back together.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.490
Adachi and Toji?

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:22.830
After being hurt, the girl runs back to
her first love! It happens all the time.

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:25.500
Boy, it seems all kinds of
rumors are floating around.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:28.500
Yeah. Has someone said
something ugly to you?

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:32.510
Uh-uh... Everyone seems
to be sympathetic.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:35.040
Well, people will be talking for a while,

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.180
but if the two of us hang in there,
there'll be no problem.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:41.510
And if anyone says anything
to you, you tell me.

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:48.860
Toji's so sweet! He's always looking
after me. l can relax when l'm with him.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.960
l think if l had been alone,
l wouldn't have recovered this quickly.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:54.120
l'm so glad Toji was there for me.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:14:00.390
And this time, for sure, l'm going
to take good care of this love.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.800
Okay?

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.810
Ah! Did you take a digital photo of me?!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:06.810
Sure did!

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.770
Take one of me!

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:16.820
Look at all the fuss they make!

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.150
Makes me wanna throw up!

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:21.490
Kairi! Take one of us, too!

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:23.890
Okay! Here we go!

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.170
--Yay!
--Yay!

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:38.070
Did it come out good?

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:40.840
Lemme see! Lemme see!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:44.310
Sorry! I messed up! Let's do it again!

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.470
"'Nurse's Office"'

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:49.880
I hear you're walking around
dripping with girls.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.180
You're ruining your reputation.

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:54.520
But, now that I'm free,
I'm pretty popular!

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:57.980
Are you sure you just want to let
this thing with Adachi-san go like this?

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.760
You see, the way I feel is this...

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:07.160
I feel like I stumbled just
as I was winning the race.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:12.300
A race that I was sure to win,
but I looked away.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:19.050
Then later on, it does no good to say,
"'I should have won that race!"'

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.210
You can't take it back.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.150
Having a relationship with someone...

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.820
...means you have to
be paying attention every moment.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.160
I'm just finding this out.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:35.360
Oh, boy... I did a really dumb thing...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.500
Yes?

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.590
Hello? Ryo-sama? It's me-

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.510
Okayasu!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:53.850
W- what?!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:56.180
Lend me your cell phone!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.180
Call Ryo-sama up!

00:15:58.180 --> 00:15:59.520
Why should I?

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:03.120
Because Ryo-sama
is sure to listen to you!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.460
Forget it. Do it yourself.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:07.460
But he hangs up on me!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:08.800
Did something happen
between you and Ryo?

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.790
Never mind! Just call him!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:16.140
Tell you what. If you'll do a favor
for me, then I'll call him for you.

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:18.140
W- what?

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:20.610
Sae-chan, did you tell Momo-chan

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:22.810
that I went looking for her
on the day of the typhoon?

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.480
I haven't said anything.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:27.480
Yeah? I get it...

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:31.150
Here I went to all the trouble
to get to Shiranami by taxi,

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.820
but Momo-chan and Toji were together,
and it was a huge shock for me.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:35.490
I want to break those two up,

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:37.160
and Sae-chan, you're just
the one to appeal to Momo-chan,

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:40.490
and tell her how much effort
I went to for her sake!

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:43.430
After all, you're the only one who
knows what happened that day, Sae-chan.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:46.170
So, if you would, please?

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.840
Hmmm... Well, okay.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:51.300
Now I know she'll never say a word...

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:56.840
Yes?

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.850
Ryo? It's me.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.780
What's this? This is unusual.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:05.120
Um, listen, could we get together today?
Tomorrow would be okay, too...

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.120
Oh, tomorrow?

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:10.120
Yeah, that's fine.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:13.320
Why? Well, I'll tell you when I see you.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.460
No, I'm not up to anything!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:18.460
Yeah, I'll send an email with
the time and place later... Bye.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:20.800
"'I'll email you later"'
Yeah, I'll send an email with
the time and place later... Bye.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:21.230
Yeah, I'll send an email with
the time and place later... Bye.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:27.810
Thank you, Okayasu!
So, where will we meet him?!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.140
Wait, I've got nothing to do with this.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:32.810
Whaddaya mean?! You're going, too!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.480
Huh?! Why do I have to go?!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:37.150
Because if it's just me by myself,
then Ryo-sama will leave!

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:40.820
Yeah, right. And why should
I go to such trouble for you?

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:44.160
Then what you just asked me to do about
appealing to Momo-chan- I'm not doing it!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.160
Oh, that's dirty!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.830
Kairi? You forgot this...

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:53.500
You again! What the hell are you doing,
showing your face to me, you pig!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:57.500
You're a piece of work! Trying to
steal my man from me! Cheeky bitch!

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:02.600
You think he'd ever truly have
anything to do with you? Ryo is my man!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:09.450
W- what happened
between you and Sae-chan?

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:12.980
That day I went to
Ryo-kun's hospital room...

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:33.200
Aki?

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.480
Ryo-kun!

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:41.810
It's dark out. Have you been
here with me the whole time?

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.150
What are you crying for?

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:47.820
I'm... I'm so relieved, that suddenly...

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:51.820
Ryo-kun, I'm so glad that you're all right!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.120
I'm sorry. That must have
been frightening for you.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.770
In my dreams, there was
a lovely fragrance...

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:05.440
I wondered where the flowers had
come from, but it was you, Aki.

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:10.110
It was a beautiful fragrance.
Sweet and soothing...

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:12.110
I love you!

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.740
I love you, Ryo-kun!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:19.450
I've loved you for ages and ages!

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:22.790
No... Is that true?

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:25.120
Oh, dear... What shall I do?

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:27.460
I'm sorry... This is a burden for you...

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.430
I'm unbelievably happy...

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:36.430
All this time... I thought
my love was unrequited...

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.410
What are you doing?!

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:52.410
K- Kashiwagi-san?

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:58.480
Get away from Ryo, you pig!

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:08.870
Get out!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:20.180
Wow... Such carnage
going on behind my back...

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:24.180
B- but it's a good thing that you could
tell him how you felt, Misao-chan!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:26.850
And Ryo felt the same way, right?

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:31.520
A good thing? I don't know.
I'm a bit confused now...

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:33.190
About Sae-chan?

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:35.530
Well, that, too.

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:38.500
That Ryo-kun could hit Kashiwagi-san
without a moment's hesitation

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.200
really surprised me.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:43.870
And even though Kashiwagi-san was crying,
he didn't do a single thing for her.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.540
Ryo-kun's never been like that before...

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:49.570
No, that's exactly what
he's been like, from long ago.

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:55.240
Does this mean the brainwashing
will wear off any day now?

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:00.220
Morning! Were you waiting?

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:02.490
No. Are you free after school today?

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:03.490
Mm-hmm.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.120
Wanna go someplace?

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.430
We've got a date!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.460
Something good happen?

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:15.840
Huh? What's that?

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.500
It's that test copy.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.170
Today we're doing our strength tests...

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:23.510
Ah! I forgot it! It's in my desk!
I'll go get it!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:24.870
Better hurry!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.850
Man, that Sumire-chan is cute!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:33.520
How did you get these?

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.520
Oh, with that digital camera
the other day?

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:38.520
Yeah... If you like, I can
print you out some copies...

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:39.860
I want this one!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.190
Gimme Kyoko!

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:42.190
Rinka!

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:45.200
Hold it, hold it!
I'll write it all down!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.870
Okay, Kyoko-chan and Rinka-chan...

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.200
Man, I can't wait!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.870
What're we doing in gym class today?

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.870
I think it's basketball...

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.880
Aw, really? I'm no good at it.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:58.610
You're good at it, right?

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:03.820
Um... that copy... that copy...

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:05.920
Got it!

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:08.390
"'Student Notebook"'

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:10.520
Whose is this?

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:18.830
W- what is this? This is me!
Oh, yuck! Who would...

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:21.770
"'Student Identification No. 333c"'
"'Second Year Class 3
Okayasu Kairi (16 Years Old)"'

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.040
Why?

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:42.800
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:52.480
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:55.480
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.480 --> 00:23:02.090
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:08.430
Where can we go

00:23:08.430 --> 00:23:18.100
where we can all be

00:23:18.100 --> 00:23:20.770
under the same sky?

00:23:20.770 --> 00:23:29.110
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.110 --> 00:23:35.790
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:42.130
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.130 --> 00:23:49.470
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:57.200
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:05.080
Why, Ryo?! No! l have to have you!

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:11.090
Don't leave me alone! Please!
l'll do anything you want! Ryo!

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:14.150
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'Imaginary Love Affair"'
